	(label "VOUT" (at 154.94 91.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2dacfb63-36ee-531f-8c56-5e9fa3673ca2"))
	(text "J2 = 0-0.6 V sensor input (R5 holds it at 0 V when unplugged), J3 = amplified output.\nInput is ground-referenced, so no Vcc/2 bias network is needed (LM358 inputs work down to 0 V).\nU1A is unused: wired as a follower with + grounded, per the datasheet.\nOnly one op-amp section does real work: on one copper layer, signals cannot cross between the\npin 1-3 and pin 5-7 sides of the DIP without passing under it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 60.96 127 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cbdc3f48-b34b-5081-8fd5-b5482ec3c506"))
